[{"title":"琴溪宅分韵得纪字","author":"何瑭","text":"国子先生前太史，大暑开筵梵宫里。\n南风生凉差可喜，况有冰浆浸寒李。\n饮酣执盏逡巡起，一语相期誓终始。\n诸公尽是天下士，瀛海散仙安足拟。\n人生百年风过耳，愿竭丹心报天子，名垂万古无泥滓。\n莫笑狂歌同下里，四美二难聊用纪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其一 凤山翥云","author":"何瑭","text":"巉然千仞峰，宛似九苞鸟。\n神游乘兴时，骑上青云表。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其二 鹞石横秋","author":"何瑭","text":"怪石如秋隼，凌空势欲飞。\n英贤神采异，彷佛见光辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其三 九华列戟","author":"何瑭","text":"九峰如列戟，拱立墓门前。\n见说簪缨后，功名继祖先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其四 双溪环带","author":"何瑭","text":"溪水如环带，分明束墓腰。\n追思游衍日，曳履过危桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其五 枫湖浸月","author":"何瑭","text":"秋月映秋波，清彻世无比。\n犹似见亲心，泪洒枫湖水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其六 芙蕖簇锦","author":"何瑭","text":"英魂招不起，应在此徜徉。\n红绿波相映，真成锦绣乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱生坟前八景 其七 芦花喷雪","author":"何瑭","text":"芦花秋似雪，掩映钓鱼舟。\n先世嬉游处，经过泪暗流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过却金馆","author":"何瑭","text":"却金本是寻常事，凛凛清风只至今。\n若使仕途贪者少，夷齐名姓亦消沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士","author":"何瑭","text":"杏坛寂寂罕言命，沧海茫茫空问津。\n今日见君谈甲子，守株翻却是高人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉华山","author":"何瑭","text":"故乡王屋比瀛州，足迹中年未一游。\n玉华岭南千万里，几时飞舄到峰头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈琴川","author":"何瑭","text":"此别重逢未有期，东西相望漫相思。\n一编管见聊持赠，披阅应同对面时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"稚子江边携水去，野人云外采樵归。\n閒亭昼永红尘净，坐看幽禽自在飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"洞箫吹彻大江风，回首曹刘事业空。\n赤壁仙翁竟何处，青山依旧月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其三","author":"何瑭","text":"直道难容今古同，江边谁识玉堂公。\n万言书在人人读，惆怅相看是画中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其四","author":"何瑭","text":"争名争利笑人忙，白水青林且退藏。\n想是雄心消未尽，却来棋上斗存亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其五","author":"何瑭","text":"两地相思见面难，暂将微物寄平安。\n亲朋问我年来事，閒看渔翁把钓竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其六","author":"何瑭","text":"三鸟不知是何鸟，相向飞鸣不肯休。\n劝尔早寻高树宿，萧萧芦苇不禁秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其七","author":"何瑭","text":"平川烟草自萋萋，南北东西路不迷。\n牛饱心閒无外事，扬鞭笑指晚山低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其八","author":"何瑭","text":"夜深惟恐蛟龙斗，急早仓皇负网归。\n莫道江湖能远害，人生随处要知几。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂画九首 其九","author":"何瑭","text":"独坐江楼思渺然，晚云散尽月当天。\n同心相访须相见，不比山阴雪后船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀陆子渊","author":"何瑭","text":"共谁虚室细谈玄，东望江云意渺然。\n忆昔少年今老矣，不堪吟对菊花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵子昂鳜图","author":"何瑭","text":"曾闻鱼藻颂皇都，见说杭城殿阁芜。\n却想王孙挥笔处，也应回首念西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅雪卷二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"榾柮烟消纸帐温，梅花雪影共黄昏。\n兴来我欲閒相访，分付奚童莫掩门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅雪卷二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"梅花开放雪花飞，矮屋斜穿一径微。\n松顶忽闻玄鹤唳，主人扶杖夜深归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次邹谦之除夜韵","author":"何瑭","text":"为惜佳时暂举杯，春光闻道隔年回。\n凭谁细话真消息，起向前轩玩蚤梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送秦世观宣府督粮","author":"何瑭","text":"晓日都门道，春风送客行。\n转轮明主托，规戒故人情。\n政事忙多错，嫌疑谤易生。\n至诚能动物，元不在声名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张仲修河东巡盐","author":"何瑭","text":"河东盐课事，军国用斯存。\n锦绮商人富，青骢使者尊。\n沟渠怜赤子，霄汉隔金门。\n无限忧时意，临岐不尽论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨太常归省","author":"何瑭","text":"卿寺迁乔久，家山入梦频。\n暂辞黄阁老，归慰白头亲。\n道路无多虑，将迎有故人。\n圣朝须佐理，莫恋锦江春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送穆司成之南监","author":"何瑭","text":"南京根本地，司业范模官。\n今日须君往，他年作鉴看。\n文章回古道，风俗障狂澜。\n惆怅临岐处，天时渐渐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归雁次孟望之韵","author":"何瑭","text":"何处堪惆怅，归鸿嘹唳音。\n关山千里路，光景四时心。\n影入春风静，声传画阁深。\n冥冥霄汉上，罗网莫相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬孟望之次韵","author":"何瑭","text":"忆昔梁园会，怜君意气投。\n云霄方并辔，风浪复同舟。\n黄屋空回首，清樽且解忧。\n贾生如晓事，应不吊湘流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊林缵妻死节","author":"何瑭","text":"一醮期偕老，殉夫遂杀身。\n闺门怜弱质，高节见斯人。\n月照鸳帷冷，苔封马鬣新。\n彝伦关政体，谁为奏枫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽谢木斋","author":"何瑭","text":"四海文章伯，三朝柱石臣。\n林泉谋养浩，山岳恸归神。\n门下依仁久，天涯洒泪新。\n束刍无路奠，肠断浙江滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨宪长家手卷二首 其一 云程万里","author":"何瑭","text":"万里青云路，先生次第行。\n山川频按节，夷夏尽知名。\n令肃豺狼避，恩深草树荣。\n犹思补丹扆，驱马向神京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨宪长家手卷二首 其二 激浊扬清","author":"何瑭","text":"黄甲蜚英俊，乌台早致身。\n澄清曾揽辔，忠鲠独埋轮。\n勋业追前辈，风声起后人。\n九原松柏冷，相望欲伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯氏忠义录","author":"何瑭","text":"海内传忠义，侯君世德长。\n鼓盆居静室，挥剑死封疆。\n祠柏凌霜翠，亭梅带雪香。\n台山南望处，彷佛见辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和郭杏东除夜韵二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"除夜围儿女，高堂隔老亲。\n本无经世策，空作去乡人。\n勋业看吾友，蹉跎叹此身。\n家山并仕路，来往自嫌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和郭杏东除夜韵二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"岁序如流水，滔滔不肯休。\n青灯相对坐，浊酒暂扳留。\n身世将安适，才疏拙自谋。\n梅花开雪里，笑尔不知愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦次蒲汀韵二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"身事怜衰白，羁栖感岁年。\n云霞占晓日，花柳媚晴川。\n家远书难得，鸿归信欲传。\n高台频极目，风景故依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦次蒲汀韵二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"风物开新岁，关山念远游。\n慈闱三载别，宦邸一身留。\n诗酒聊乘兴，烟花岂解愁。\n目穷飞鸟外，魂断仲宣楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日","author":"何瑭","text":"岁事卜阴晴，朝来雾气清。\n天开熙皞象，风度笑歌声。\n丰稔传乡国，繁华记帝城。\n客居无好况，愁减为苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵挽陈虚庵二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"虚庵今已矣，东望一伤心。\n情爱三秋月，刚凝百鍊金。\n犹悬徐孺榻，谁和伯牙琴。\n欲写循良传，翻嫌职掌侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵挽陈虚庵二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"见说毗陵守，无如公最贤。\n化行风偃草，心静月当天。\n士颂真君子，民歌大有年。\n熙熙并皞皞，史笔恐难传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送左都颜先生入京","author":"何瑭","text":"圣主坐明堂，霜台振纪纲。\n老臣膺简命，南国倍辉光。\n已觉豺狼遁，遥看凤鸟翔。\n离筵回首处，秋思正茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"类庵宅","author":"何瑭","text":"洞天何处好，清爱水晶宫。\n宗伯开华宴，群仙醉碧筒。\n蔗凝金椀露，花动翠帘风。\n岂必浮沧海，瀛洲在此中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敝宅分题得观音梅水","author":"何瑭","text":"远映观音阁，梅花烟水寒。\n暗香盈断浦，疏影落轻澜。\n漱玉声相应，和羹子半酸。\n瀛洲何异此，登眺共凭栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽西郊宋处士夫妇","author":"何瑭","text":"诗酒陶元亮，潇条住远坰。\n伤哉新冢白，愁对旧山青。\n同穴怜双璧，传家在一经。\n笑谈春满座，人共相仪刑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次杏东元宵韵二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"帝城元夜盛，灯火画堂深。\n节序同南北，人情变古今。\n山河怜晚霁，花柳怯春阴。\n笑语喧儿女，翻伤老大心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次杏东元宵韵二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"灯火逢元夜，萍蓬叹索居。\n感时知我老，得句遣儿书。\n酒少愁难破，年衰恨有馀。\n团团天上月，几见缺如梳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次对雪韵二首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"夜雪深过尺，春城碍出游。\n且斟浇闷酒，休上望乡楼。\n齿发真堪念，声名不用流。\n行当谢明主，归去故山头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次对雪韵二首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"感时惊雨雪，抚已惜精神。\n镜里容非旧，天涯岁又新。\n愁来便枕簟，客至强冠巾。\n聚散思今昔，相看意更亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月八日午门赐宴次秉衡韵","author":"何瑭","text":"节惊蓂荚问元初，浴佛传来贝叶书。\n龙陛玉音催赐宴，凤楼琼席坐连裾。\n抗章有志同韩愈，献赋无才似子虚。\n不是圣明重异教，欲将奇怪骇吾儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宗藩孝行","author":"何瑭","text":"玉树分枝帝室亲，昭然诚孝冠群伦。\n寸心哀慕穷天地，永夜悲号动鬼神。\n高冢松楸频洒泪，名园桃李谩生春。\n凭谁写入丹青传，大播遗风起后人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王教之端册业","author":"何瑭","text":"慈闱高行并南山，文母徽音尚可攀。\n孝子誊书驰驿骑，圣君闻奏动天颜。\n玉阶遣使纶音重，金殿承恩羽扇间。\n莫道寻常内家事，帝王风化正相关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李守正归棠邑省亲","author":"何瑭","text":"宦途邂逅与君同，又见归旌逐断鸿。\n东观月明清梦远，北堂春好寿颜红。\n沧溟汗漫鱼龙水，平野萧条草木风。\n忠孝此行真两尽，天涯极目思无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其一","author":"何瑭","text":"出谷莺啼杨柳丝，客边风景似年时。\n西山冻释抽新草，上苑春归入故枝。\n心念旧游频眺望，梦回残月倍相思。\n催朝无奈鸡鸣早，又逐群英过凤池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其二","author":"何瑭","text":"故园门巷枕黄河，散乱牛羊草满坡。\n两岸夕阳行客棹，一犁春雨老农蓑。\n拨醅酒熟尊颜醉，击缶声喧稚子歌。\n一别天涯几芳草，梦回茅屋月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其三","author":"何瑭","text":"黄金台畔太行隈，千里风光一日回。\n白马渡迷芳草合，紫金坛迥曙烟开。\n笙歌到处留人醉，车马谁家上冢来。\n坐想旧游真似梦，野花黄蝶遍蒿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其四","author":"何瑭","text":"盘谷燕川二月寒，马头溪水隔天坛。\n黄茅踏遍幽人径，白石烧成道士丹。\n风煖野禽朝对语，月明松鹤夜交欢。\n采真拟结峰头屋，引领西南尽日看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其五","author":"何瑭","text":"十里云霞锁洞天，灵踪千古尚依然。\n老君池水深春雨，黄帝松阴暗晓烟。\n盘谷断碑芳草外，玉川茅屋野花前。\n别来胜景应如昨，归去繁霜惧满颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其六","author":"何瑭","text":"目穷郊野遍芳菲，清晓登楼转夕晖。\n风撼上阶花影乱，雨滋穿土草芽肥。\n采芝商岭人何处，种菊浔阳事已非。\n同学故人偏自得，海鸥沙际共忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其七","author":"何瑭","text":"闻道商山老紫芝，百年短景不胜悲。\n红尘满眼空怜我，青史流芳竟属谁。\n杖化葛陂龙去远，笙闻缑岭鹤来迟。\n王孙草绿烟汀晚，独倚危栏自咏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸亥杂诗八首 其八","author":"何瑭","text":"青春回首思悠悠，王屋山高沁水流。\n观国念存空倚剑，思乡魂断独登楼。\n悲呜夜月笼中鹤，泛滥春波海上鸥。\n寂寂桑榆敛残照，丽谯吹角使人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追挽王户部","author":"何瑭","text":"马鬣西风吹野蒿，襄城南望梦魂劳。\n趋尘不及瞻犀表，继踵空怜识凤毛。\n玄武挂冠头正黑，青云倚剑志犹高。\n是谁写入巢由传，不说勋名在户曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追挽复斋王宪副","author":"何瑭","text":"清新曾读复斋诗，眉宇居然见紫芝。\n翰苑鸟台怜往事，青蝇白璧恨当时。\n平原草满鸰飞急，孤冢苔荒鹤吊迟。\n我欲招魂歌楚些，乾坤浩渺不胜悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望泰陵次序庵韵","author":"何瑭","text":"玄扃一自掩重关，惆怅龙髯不再攀。\n绛节定应归帝所，翠华无复到尘寰。\n乱峰残照玄猿哭，衰草寒烟石兽閒。\n载笔小臣凝望久，玉楼瑶殿倚空山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送罗户侯归成都","author":"何瑭","text":"腰间锦带佩双龙，万里东来谒九重。\n剑外风烟怜独往，日边甥舅记相逢。\n雪消汉水连天阔，春尽巴云入树浓。\n麟阁于今待勋烈，莫将韬略老藩封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送野汀祭扫","author":"何瑭","text":"道途豺虎正纵横，底事归轩冒险行。\n霄汉一身明主托，江山万里老臣情。\n云迷汴宋怀松槚，路入衡漳敛旆旌。\n回首天门纷羽檄，可能乡社恋莼羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘仲鲁使安南","author":"何瑭","text":"风尘时节送君行，萍水分携百感生。\n六馆交游曾刮目，十年离合最关情。\n山川渺渺蛮中路，雾雨昏昏海上城。\n玉册已颁王事毕，便催车马转归旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬李序庵次韵","author":"何瑭","text":"鞍马红尘日送迎，累惊时节变阴晴。\n白衣苍狗有何意，流水高山无限情。\n把酒旧曾临郑圃，题诗谁复共韩檠。\n故人若问年来事，华发新从镜里生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":58640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]